 and deep learning. We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":227892,"global_rank":117509,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20286},{"name":"schlarpc/packmodule","owner":"schlarpc","html_url":"https://github.com/schlarpc/packmodule","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python code packer for AWS Lambda","topics":[],"score":227882,"global_rank":241697,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20287},{"name":"colobas/obras","owner":"colobas","html_url":"https://github.com/colobas/obras","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"hard difficult expert very tough","topics":[],"score":227878,"global_rank":117527,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20288},{"name":"izhangzhihao/zhwiki-word2vec","owner":"izhangzhihao","html_url":"https://github.com/izhangzhihao/zhwiki-word2vec","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227878,"global_rank":117529,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20289},{"name":"codynhat/mmpool","owner":"codynhat","html_url":"https://github.com/codynhat/mmpool","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227878,"global_rank":117530,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20290},{"name":"mfazza/Networks","owner":"mfazza","html_url":"https://github.com/mfazza/Networks","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":["chat","python","socket","socket-programming"],"score":227877,"global_rank":117532,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20291},{"name":"LindsayHill/maclookup","owner":"LindsayHill","html_url":"https://github.com/LindsayHill/maclookup","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Basic Mac Lo